ms of making sure it doesn’t degrade from the stomach acids, and you have the antioxidant protection of astaxanthin together with hyaluronic acid. I think Ingenious is a no brainer”</p>\n<p><strong>The world’s first patented and independent clinically proven collagen supplement.<br></strong>This is your ultimate beauty multi-tasker delivering real results to skin, hair and nails.</p>\n<p><strong>TRIPLE ACTIVE FORMULA:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Marine collagen peptides stimulate the skin’s natural collagen production</li>\n<li>Hyaluronic acid complex for optimal hydration levels</li>\n<li>Natural astaxanthin helps prevent visible signs of premature ageing</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>CLINICALLY PROVEN TO:</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Reduce fine lines and wrinkles</li>\n<li>Increase hydration</li>\n<li>Improve elasticity</li>\n<li>Even out skin tone</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"height: 134px;\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><br></div>\n  </rte-formatter>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"shopify-block-AMnRTcDBMNmJnaGNYK__blog-post-product\" class=\"shopify-block\">\n\n\n    <div class=\"related-product-wrapper-bg\">\n        \n                <div class=\"related-product-wrapper\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"related-product-image\">\n                        <a href=\"/products/ingenious-collagen\">\n                            \n                                <img src=\"/assets/96d72a51-Group_1073714959_copy.png\" alt=\"Collagen+\" class=\"related-product-img\">\n                            \n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                    <div class=\"related-product-details\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                        <h2 class=\"related-product-title\">COLLAGEN+</h2>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                        <p c